#>plan_agentic_dev_contracts_wip
#:operation #!cache
#:fixity #!tending
#:layer #!pragmatics

@plan: ~"./PLAN.md"
@index: ~"./index.spw"
@wip_notebook: ~"../../../.spw/conventions/wip-notebook.spw"
@check_site: ~"../../../scripts/check-site.mjs"
@site_contracts: ~"../../../scripts/site-contracts.mjs"
@route_manifest: ~"../../../scripts/generate-route-runtime-manifest.mjs"

operation = "cache"
fixity = "tending"

^"stream"{
 >>[2026-10-12 10:59] verify — the manifest scripts and check:local stand, and both wonder probes in index.spw pass today. The condition the Status sets for archiving has been met: d13a532f turned the last twenty audit-first check steps into check:local, and no live plan validates with the audit-first script now. That same pass also rewrote the script_door wonder's tension to name check:local as the network detour, which inverted it; the tension was restored the same day to name the bare check script.
}

^"open"{
 script_door = ~"./index.spw#wonder_plan_script_door"
 stamp = ~"./index.spw#wonder_plan_stamp"
}

^"cache"{
 ~#status: "tending"
 ~#next_commit: "&[plans] Archive agentic-dev-contracts as landed, now that every plan names check:local, and carry its two questions to agent-optimization"
 ~#files_hot: "scripts/check-site.mjs, scripts/site-contracts.mjs, scripts/generate-route-runtime-manifest.mjs, package.json"
 ~#gate: "nothing; the two wonders need a new home in agent-optimization's index.spw before the folder moves"
 ~#last_stream: "2026-10-12"
}
